        "title": "Hyperpure: supplying a restaurant’s kitchen",
        "examples": "Ingredients, kitchen supplies and related delivery services.",
        "explanation": "Imagine a restaurant buying ingredients for the meals it will cook. Hyperpure arranges supplies and delivery to that business. Stock, storage and transport costs must be covered even if the goods create a large sales total."
