        "examples": "Infosys Cobalt, infrastructure and security services.",
        "explanation": "Cloud means computing resources accessed over a network. A customer may need help moving its programs and information, connecting them and keeping them secure. Cobalt is a name for a collection of related offerings, not a separate profit statement."
